Changelog for triplclust
========================

Version 2.0.0 from 2026-10-21
=============================

 - triplclust now returns information about clustering process in
   entries "params" and "cdist"

 - new function plot_threshold() to visualize automatic threshold selection

 - documentation improvements
    o if a functions return no value, that is now documented
	o all functions now have a description
	o documentation of function triplclust() separated
	  from package documentation
	o examples that use unnecessary third party dependencies
	  now wrapped with donttest instead of dontrun


Version 1.0.0 from 2026-10-10
=============================

 - first release
